<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Metro Networks said upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Metro Networks said upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette analyst John Whittier upgraded Metro Networks Inc to buy, according to a DLJ source.</p>
<p>-- other details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares gained 1/8 to 24.</p>
